  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="134">
        <pb n="174"/>
        <head>134 — i — IV. — <quote>I will speak the praises of the Lord with my mouth</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="preface">
          <ab n="1">On the Holy <persName>Thomas</persName> the Apostle Alone.</ab>
        </div>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="2">When we celebrate thy<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> commemoration, Apostle <persName>Thomas</persName>, we remember the divine salvation that was wrought for us by thy means. For by beneficially [doubting in thy faith<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> and touching God who had become incarnate thou showedst those that are affected with the disease of the phantasy concerning the Humanization of the Word to be children of error; and thou didst convict and expose<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> the preachers of the evil heresy of the Diphysites, in that thou didst recognise God of God, who became man without variation for our sake, to <pb n="175"/> be one and the same; to whom we, worshipping with thee, say<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> with faith, <quote>My Lord<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> and my God, praise to thee!</quote></ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 174, n. 2</orig></choice> Ps. cxliv, 21.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 174, n. 3</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>At thy</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 174, n. 4</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>not believing</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 174, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>mock at</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 175, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>we say</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 175, n. 2</orig></choice> John xx, 24-29 <quote>But <persName>Thomas</persName>..... nails and place my hand in his side, I will not..... have believed.</quote></note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
